# Bergdb item 001, C-CUT (WP R7): a cut that CutOK does not allow. The nodes of
# R(0) are reachable at every time, and none is written again; T(2) moves the
# first available time to 1 and decides a cut at 1. Expected: the record and D
# are the model's, and the cut fails CutOK's part 2 (CUT-reach).
TRACE 2
CONFIG cut
TX 0
NEW 0 9 I
NEW 3 8 I
NEW 5 3 I
NEW 7 2 I
ADD 0 0 T 3
ADD 3 0 R 5
ADD 5 0 K 10 7
REC 0 0 0 field 3
VER 3 I
H 0 R 5
F 5 0
VER 5 I
H 0 K 10 7
F 7 0
VER 7 I
DIRTY
END 0
TX 1
REC 1 0 0 field 3
GD
DIRTY
END 1
TX 2
REC 2 1 0 field 3
GD
DIRTY
FA 1
CUT 1 1
END 2
DONE 2
